@startuml sequence-send-notification
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
title Sequence — Send notification (UC8a, included in UC8)
participant ":ReservationService" as Res
participant ":EmailNotificationService" as Email
participant ":LoggingNotificationService" as Log
participant "SMTP server" as SMTP
actor Customer

note over Res
  r has just become CONFIRMED (UC8).
  Which implementation of NotificationService
  is used is decided once, at startup.
end note

alt SMTP is configured (SMTP_HOST)
  Res -> Email : send_confirmation(r, user)
  Email -> Email : compose the e-mail\n(reservation no., dates, price)
  Email -> SMTP : send(e-mail)
  alt e-mail sent
    SMTP -> Customer : confirmation e-mail
    Email --> Res : true
  else sending failed
    SMTP --> Email : error
    Email -> Email : log the error\n(r stays CONFIRMED)
    Email --> Res : false
  end
else no SMTP
  Res -> Log : send_confirmation(r, user)
  Log -> Log : write the notification to the log
  Log --> Res : true
end
@enduml
